  "limits": [
    "Two separate short C8 capture campaigns on the same original launcher, model, load and profiler config. Values are differences of medians over original and modified cohorts, not paired causal reductions.",
    "Each target graph has 40 real FFN calls and eight QLI sites. Scope covers source layer 20 and the four later consumers. The source-end to sparse-attention-entry interval charges the converter plus existing work and waiting. Model-wide differences outside that interval are retained in total graph and period metrics.",
    "TP maxima use only actual eight-rank HCCL group and operation matches; device time differences within each rank require no cross-device clock alignment. Durations spanning more layers also contain other work; independent campaigns can differ in EP waits, host activity and actual padded lengths.",
    "The endpoint sensitivity transfers the measured scoped change to natural full steps of joint168. Equality of the eight archived output texts and one restored C8 do not establish a repeatable service acceleration."
  ],
